; GENERATED from specs/physics/formula_registry.t27 -- do not hand-edit (DRY: the registry is the SSOT).
; Regenerate: extract every fn preceded by a "[VERIFIED] sector= cx= delta=" tag line; each fn's return expression,
; its value evaluated in f64 (phi, pi, e as in the registry), its sector, and the tag's deviation in thousandths of a percent.
; Only VERIFIED rows are emitted: conjectures and failures never reach the brand visual (AGENTS.md "Brand visual").
; Source of every row: the Pellis/Vasilev/Olsen "Sacred Formula" paper (research/trinity-pellis-paper/), compared with CODATA/PDG.

